<title>FRANCE: Alcatel, Motorola in TETRA deal.</title>
<headline>Alcatel, Motorola in TETRA deal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom's mobile communications division said it had signed a framework agreement with Motorola for the TETRA standard and PMR equipment.</p>
<p>TETRA stands for Trans European Trunked Radio while PMR are professional mobile radios.</p>
<p>The company said that the deal allowed both companies to offer turn-key solutions to their customers.</p>
